<title>USA: Devon Group Q2 earnings seen short.</title>
<headline>Devon Group Q2 earnings seen short.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Devon Group Inc said on Wednesday that it expects its second-quarter earnings to fall short of analysts' estimates for the second consecutive quarter.</p>
<p>The projection is based on current estimates, the company said.</p>
<p>One analysts has projected second-quarter earnings of $0.96, while another has projected $1.02 -- for an average projection of $0.99 for the quarter, said Bruce Koch, a spokesman for the company.</p>
